---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Readings">
  <div class="feed">
    <div class="content-card">
      <div class="post-content">
<p>My intuitive readings are based on cardology. Using your birth date, I look into your cardology chart and read intuitively from there, following what is most relevant to you and your query. 
<p>
No two readings are the same; each session unfolds based on where you are and what you're seeking clarity on.
</p>

        <div class="readings-pricing">
          <div class="reading-tier">
            <div class="reading-header">
              <span class="reading-name">Mini Reading</span>
              <span class="reading-price">$50</span>
            </div>
            <span class="reading-duration">30 minutes · via Zoom</span>
          </div>
          <div class="reading-tier">
            <div class="reading-header">
              <span class="reading-name">Full Reading</span>
              <span class="reading-price">$80</span>
            </div>
            <span class="reading-duration">60 minutes · via Zoom</span>
          </div>
          <div class="reading-tier">
            <div class="reading-header">
              <span class="reading-name">Deep Dive</span>
              <span class="reading-price">$120</span>
            </div>
            <span class="reading-duration">90 minutes · via Zoom</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="readings-divider" />
       <div class="book-cta">
  <a href="https://calendly.com/rekhasreflections" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="book-button">
    Book Your Reading →
  </a>
</div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .readings-pricing {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .reading-tier {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e5e5);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .reading-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .reading-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .reading-price {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .reading-duration {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }

  .readings-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e5e5);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .booking-note {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .booking-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .form-group label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .form-group input,
  .form-group select,
  .form-group textarea {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e5e5);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .form-group textarea {
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .paypal-note {
    background: var(--card-bg, #f9f9f9);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e5e5);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .paypal-note p {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .paypal-button {
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #003087;
  }

  .paypal-button:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .submit-button {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--accent-color, #333);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .submit-button:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
</style>
